{{Quote|Look outside. Is the world more peaceful since the revolution? I see nothing but death and chaos.|"[[The Client]]," to [[Din Djarin]]|<ref name="Chapter 7">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 7: The Reckoning}}</ref>}}
The '''New Republic Era''',<ref name="Visual Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> also known as the '''era of the New Republic''',<ref name="Bloodline" /> the '''age of the New Republic''',<ref name="sw100">''[[Star Wars 100 Objects]]''</ref> or the '''post-Imperial era'''<ref name="POV 222">{{InsiderCite|222|A Certain Point of View}}</ref> was the period of [[time]] that immediately followed the [[Imperial Era]]. It was marked by the [[Declaration of a New Republic|restoration]] of the [[Galactic Republic|Old Republic]] as the [[Democracy|democratic]] [[New Republic]], which was gradually established after the [[Battle of Endor|defeat]] of the [[Fascism|fascist]] [[Galactic Empire]] at [[Endor]].<ref name="Aftermath">[[Aftermath (novel)|''Aftermath'']]</ref> A [[galactic recession]] that heavily impacted<ref name="sw100" /> the economy, including [[fuel]] prices,<ref name="Mando1">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 1: The Mandalorian}}</ref> and the [[Bounty hunter|bounty hunting]] trade was underway around [[9 ABY]].<ref name="sw100" />

Although the period was mostly an era of peace, the government's lack of vigilance ultimately led to [[Politics|political]] fragmentation, which in turn permitted the '''Rise of the First Order'''.<ref name="SWP" /> As such, this period of time would also become known as the '''First Order Era'''.<ref name="sw100" /> The [[Hosnian Cataclysm|destruction]] of the New Republic government at the hands of the [[First Order]]'s [[Starkiller Base]]<ref name="Episode VII">{{Film|VII}}</ref> ended the New Republic and kicked off<ref name="Rise and Fall">''[[Star Wars: The Rise and Fall of the Galactic Empire]]''</ref> [[First Order-Resistance War|open war]] between the First Order and [[Resistance]].<ref name="SDCC">{{SW|url=news/star-wars-the-last-jedi-props-and-costumes-on-display-at-sdcc|text=''Star Wars: The Last Jedi'' Props and Costumes on Display at SDCC}}</ref> This began the '''Age of the Resistance'''<ref name="Resistance">[[Star Wars: Age of Resistance – The Official Collector's Edition|''Star Wars: Age of Resistance'' – The Official Collector's Edition]]</ref> or '''Era of the Resistance'''.<ref name="Droidography">''[[Star Wars: Droidography]]''</ref> The conflict ended in victory for the Resistance after the [[Battle of Exegol]]<ref name="Rise and Fall" /> and [[Uprising against the First Order|citizen uprisings]] against the First Order,<ref name="Episode IX">{{Film|IX}}</ref> but it was unclear what new kind of galactic government would emerge from the ashes of war even months after the Resistance victory.<ref name="Rise and Fall" />

